<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 189.94 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tue.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 189.94 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 189.94 million rand worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after buying 38.83 million on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
